    "intro_html":  "Fasolka po bretonsku is what Polish baked beans actually taste like: smoky bacon and sausage, white beans, tomato, thyme and a lot of smoked paprika, simmered until the whole thing goes thick. It is a genuinely cheap protein per dollar build, landing {{protein}} grams of protein for about ${{cost_ps}} a bowl (at everyday cost).",
